{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Connect — Contact & Consultation | {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#0f1113;--card:#0b0c0d;--muted:#a9b0b5;--accent:#c9a66b;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);--glass-2:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);font-family:Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background-color:var(--bg);color:#eef0f2}
    /* patterned backdrop */
    body::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');opacity:0.06;mix-blend-mode:screen;pointer-events:none}

    .container{max-width:1100px;margin:40px auto;padding:28px}
    nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:28px}
    .logo{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
    .logo .sig{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2a2f33,#141617);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.5)}
    .nav-links{display:flex;gap:14px}
    .nav-links a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px}
    .nav-links a:hover{background:var(--glass-2);color:#fff}
    header.hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:26px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(2,3,4,0.6)}
    .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:22px;align-items:stretch}

    .intro h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-0.5px}
    .intro p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    .cta-row{margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
    .btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#e6c48b);color:#221912;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:none;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
    .btn.secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:var(--muted)}

    /* contact panel */
    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.015),transparent);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    form .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
    input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.01);color:#eef0f2}
    textarea{min-height:110px}
    .small{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}

    /* aroma wheel */
    .wheel-wrap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:18px}
    .wheel{position:relative;width:300px;height:300px;border-radius:50%;background:conic-gradient(#8fb9a8 0 33%,#d6b07a 33% 66%,#7e8fb3 66% 100%);box-shadow:inset 0 -20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3),0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5)}
    .wheel .center{position:absolute;inset:90px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--glass);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent)}
    .sector{position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:50%;pointer-events:auto}
    .sector button{position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;border:none;cursor:pointer}
    .notes{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;align-items:center}
    .note-title{font-weight:700}
    .note-desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);max-width:420px;text-align:center}

    /* proof gallery */
    .proof{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start;margin-top:22px}
    .testimonials{flex:1;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .testimonials .quote{font-style:italic;color:#e9ecec}
    .meta{margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .badges{width:220px;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .badge{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--glass);position:relative}
    .badge .mark{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}
    .badge .label{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    .tooltip{position:absolute;left:calc(100% + 8px);top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);background:rgba(10,10,10,0.95);padding:8px;border-radius:8px;color:#fff;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .18s}
    .badge:hover .tooltip{opacity:1}

    footer{margin-top:34px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    @media (max-width:920px){.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.wheel{width:260px;height:260px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <nav>
      <div class="logo">
        <div class="sig">A</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-links" aria-label="primary navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="services.html">Therapies</a>
        <a href="blends.html">Custom Blends</a>
        <a href="shop.html">Boutique</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Plans</a>
        <a href="about.html">Our Story</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html" style="color:#fff;background:var(--glass);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px">Connect</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <header class="hero">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="intro">
          <h1>Connect with scent guidance that supports presence</h1>
          <p>Short, intensive consultations and curated at-home blends that may support calm, focus, and restorative pause. Appointments are custom and safety-aware — we design around your life, pets, and comfort.</p>
          <div class="cta-row">
            <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <button class="btn secondary" onclick="document.getElementById('contact-form').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">Message the Practitioner</button>
          </div>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:14px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">
            <div>Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
            <div>Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="panel">
          <div class="wheel-wrap">
            <div class="wheel" role="application" aria-label="Aroma wheel">
              <div class="sector" style="clip-path:circle(50% at 50% 18%);">
                <button data-part="top" aria-label="Top notes"></button>
              </div>
              <div class="sector" style="clip-path:ellipse(70% 70% at 50% 50%);">
                <button data-part="middle" aria-label="Middle notes"></button>
              </div>
              <div class="sector" style="clip-path:circle(50% at 50% 82%);">
                <button data-part="base" aria-label="Base notes"></button>
              </div>
              <div class="center">Aroma Wheel</div>
            </div>
            <div class="notes">
              <div class="note-title" id="note-title">Hover or focus a sector</div>
              <div class="note-desc" id="note-desc">Explore which notes are emphasized in a blend. Tap a sector to pin for details.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <div class="proof">
        <div class="testimonials" aria-live="polite">
          <div id="quote" class="quote">"Gentle, perceptive guidance — I left with a simple ritual I keep returning to."</div>
          <div id="auth" class="meta">— A. in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • Aroma Intensive</div>
        </div>

        <div class="badges" aria-hidden="false">
          <div class="badge" tabindex="0">
            <div class="mark">CR</div>
            <div class="label">Clinical Safety Review</div>
            <div class="tooltip">Independent safety review for dilution guidelines and contraindications.</div>
          </div>

          <div class="badge" tabindex="0">
            <div class="mark">AB</div>
            <div class="label">Aroma Board</div>
            <div class="tooltip">Practitioner-certified aromatherapy care principles; safety-forward approach.</div>
          </div>

          <div class="badge" tabindex="0">
            <div class="mark">PT</div>
            <div class="label">Patch-Test Protocol</div>
            <div class="tooltip">Clear, standard patch-test steps included with every custom formula.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </header>

    <main style="margin-top:18px">
      <section id="contact-form" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:18px;align-items:start">
        <div class="panel">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Send a note</h3>
          <form onsubmit="handleSubmit(event)">
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px">
              <div style="flex:1">
                <label for="name">Name</label>
                <input id="name" name="name" required />
              </div>
              <div style="width:140px">
                <label for="phone">Phone</label>
                <input id="phone" name="phone" />
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:10px">
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required />
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:10px">
              <label for="service">I am interested in</label>
              <select id="service" name="service">
                <option>Aroma Intensive — focused consult</option>
                <option>Seasonal Tune-up — 30min check</option>
                <option>Blend & Supply Consultation</option>
                <option>Wholesale / Retail Inquiry</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:10px">
              <label for="message">Message</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="A brief note about what you'd like support with (sensitivities, pregnancy, pets, etc.)"></textarea>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
              <input id="consent" type="checkbox" required />
              <label for="consent" style="margin:0">I consent to be contacted about my inquiry.</label>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:10px">
              <button class="btn" type="submit">Request Consultation</button>
              <button class="btn secondary" type="button" onclick="window.location='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'">Book a Session</button>
            </div>

            <div class="small">We aim to respond within 48 hours. For immediate help please call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--muted)">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
          </form>
        </div>

        <aside class="panel">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">What to expect</h4>
          <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)">
            <li style="margin:8px 0">Brief intake about sensory history and lifestyle</li>
            <li style="margin:8px 0">Safety-first notes on dilution and any contraindications</li>
            <li style="margin:8px 0">A clear plan: one blend, simple ritual, and patch-test steps</li>
          </ul>

          <div style="margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">
            Pricing starts at a focused consultation rate. Full programs and blend orders are customized after your intake.
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <strong>Safety notes</strong>
            <p class="small">Formulas are created with dilution guidance. Patch test is recommended. We will adapt if you are pregnant, breastfeeding, or have pets; please mention this in your message.</p>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-top:20px" aria-label="FAQ">
        <div class="panel">
          <h4 style="margin-top:0">Frequently asked</h4>
          <details style="margin-top:8px"><summary style="cursor:pointer;color:#fff">Are scents safe around children and pets?</summary>
            <div style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)">We use conservative dilution and offer pet- and family-aware guidance. Certain oils are best avoided around cats, so we tailor plans to your household.</div>
          </details>

          <details style="margin-top:8px"><summary style="cursor:pointer;color:#fff">Do you make medical claims?</summary>
            <div style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)">No medical claims are made. Aromatherapy may support aspects of wellbeing such as relaxation or attention. Any support language is non-medical and personalized.</div>
          </details>

          <details style="margin-top:8px"><summary style="cursor:pointer;color:#fff">What about dilution and patch testing?</summary>
            <div style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)">Dilution guidance is provided with each blend and a patch-test protocol is included so you can check sensitivity before regular use.</div>
          </details>

          <details style="margin-top:8px"><summary style="cursor:pointer;color:#fff">Pregnancy or medication concerns?</summary>
            <div style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)">We adapt our suggestions if you are pregnant, breastfeeding, or taking medication. Always consult with your healthcare provider as needed; we will avoid unsafe oils and advise more conservative approaches.</div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <footer>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px">
        <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • <span style="color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</span></div>
        <div style="color:var(--muted)">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--muted)">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--muted)">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Aroma wheel interactions
    (function(){
      const parts = {
        top: {title: 'Top notes — Bright & fleeting', desc: 'Lift and first impression. Typical notes: bergamot, citrus peel, litsea. Often perceived quickly; may support a sense of clarity.'},
        middle: {title: 'Middle notes — Heart & character', desc: 'The blend's body. Typical notes: lavender, geranium, cardamom. These shape the feeling as the top notes soften.'},
        base: {title: 'Base notes — Long-lasting anchor', desc: 'Grounding and lingering. Typical notes: cedarwood, vetiver, vanilla. These add depth and longevity.'}
      };
      const titleEl = document.getElementById('note-title');
      const descEl = document.getElementById('note-desc');
      let pinned = null;

      document.querySelectorAll('.sector button').forEach(btn=>{
        const part = btn.getAttribute('data-part');
        btn.addEventListener('mouseenter', ()=>{ if(!pinned) show(part) });
        btn.addEventListener('focus', ()=>{ if(!pinned) show(part) });
        btn.addEventListener('mouseleave', ()=>{ if(!pinned) reset() });
        btn.addEventListener('blur', ()=>{ if(!pinned) reset() });
        btn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ pinned = pinned===part? null : part; if(pinned) show(part); else reset() });
      });

      function show(part){
        titleEl.textContent = parts[part].title;
        descEl.textContent = parts[part].desc;
      }
      function reset(){
        titleEl.textContent = 'Hover or focus a sector';
        descEl.textContent = 'Explore which notes are emphasized in a blend. Tap a sector to pin for details.';
      }
    })();

    // Proof gallery - rotating testimonials and badge tooltips
    (function(){
      const quotes = [
        {q: 'A concise session that left me with a clear everyday ritual I actually use.', a: '— J. (Aroma Intensive)'},
        {q: 'Thoughtful formulas, with safe dilution and easy instructions.', a: '— S. (Blend & Supply)'},
        {q: 'Attentive practitioner; I appreciated the pet-aware recommendations.', a: '— R. in {{CITY}}'},
      ];
      let idx = 0; const qEl = document.getElementById('quote'), aEl = document.getElementById('auth');
      function rotate(){
        idx = (idx + 1) % quotes.length;
        qEl.style.opacity = 0; aEl.style.opacity = 0;
        setTimeout(()=>{ qEl.textContent = '"' + quotes[idx].q + '"'; aEl.textContent = quotes[idx].a; qEl.style.opacity = 1; aEl.style.opacity = 1 },250);
      }
      setInterval(rotate, 5000);

      // Simple keyboard-accessible tooltips already in CSS; ensure badges announce
      document.querySelectorAll('.badge').forEach(b=>{
        b.addEventListener('focus', ()=>{ b.querySelector('.tooltip').style.opacity=1 });
        b.addEventListener('blur', ()=>{ b.querySelector('.tooltip').style.opacity=0 });
      });
    })();

    // Form handling stub
    function handleSubmit(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const data = new FormData(e.target);
      console.log('Contact request', Object.fromEntries(data.entries()));
      alert('Thanks — your inquiry has been recorded. We will reply within 48 hours.');
      e.target.reset();
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page for the aromatherapy clinic_modern template (chunk 4).

Files in this chunk:
- contact.html — Complete contact + interactive features.

Purpose:
- Provides a contact hub with an aroma wheel (interactive top/middle/base notes), a rotating proof gallery (testimonials) and credibility badges with accessible tooltips.
- Includes a safety-forward FAQ and explicit notes about dilution, patch testing, pets, and pregnancy.
- Uses placeholders for site-wide values that must be replaced by the site generator: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.

Interactive features (implemented in contact.html):
- Aroma wheel: three interactive sectors (top, middle, base). Hover or focus to reveal note title + description; click to pin a selection.
- Proof gallery: rotates testimonial quotes every 5 seconds; badges include tooltips that appear on hover and focus for keyboard accessibility.
- Contact form: collects basic intake info and includes a safety consent. Submissions call a local handler (handleSubmit) which currently logs and acknowledges; replace with real endpoint integration as needed.

Assets:
- The layout references assets/img/pattern.svg for a low-opacity background pattern. Provide a unique SVG file at that path for full visual effect. No external fonts or CDNs are used.

Accessibility & Safety:
- Interactive controls are keyboard-focusable and include aria labels. Tooltip text is available on focus.
- FAQ emphasizes non-medical language; all support phrasing uses "may support" framing and includes instructions about patch testing, dilution, pets, and pregnancy.

Notes for integration:
- Update placeholder tokens before publishing.
- Replace the form handler with server-side processing or endpoint integration.
- Provide the required SVG at assets/img/pattern.svg; the visual style anticipates a subtle repeating motif.

Design voice: mystic_modern — modern clinical layout with gentle, grounded metaphors. Offer model: intensive."}
BUNDLE_END
